                    <span>OUR APPROACH</span>
                </div>

                <h2>
                    Precision in<br>
                    every <em>connection.</em>
                </h2>
            </div>

            <p>
                A considered approach to planning, execution,
                and quality helps keep each stage aligned with
                project requirements.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="approach-list">

            <article class="approach-item reveal">
                <span class="approach-number">01</span>

                <div class="approach-item-main">
                    <h3>Planning</h3>
                    <p>
                        Understand project requirements, coordinate
                        priorities, and prepare for the work ahead.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <span class="approach-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </article>

            <article class="approach-item reveal">
                <span class="approach-number">02</span>

                <div class="approach-item-main">
                    <h3>Execution</h3>
                    <p>
                        Keep technical details, communication,
                        and project coordination in focus.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <span class="approach-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </article>

            <article class="approach-item reveal">
                <span class="approach-number">03</span>

                <div class="approach-item-main">
                    <h3>Quality</h3>
                    <p>
                        Give attention to workmanship, inspection,
                        and applicable project specifications.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <span class="approach-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </article>

        </div>

        <div class="approach-footer reveal">
            <span>DETAILS MATTER. SO DOES THE BIGGER PICTURE.</span>
            <a href="/services" class="text-link">
                Explore our services <span>↗</span>
            </a>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>


